<title>USA: National Patent completes merger.</title>
<headline>National Patent completes merger.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Patent Development Corp said on Friday it completed the merger of General Physics Corp into a subsidiary of National Patent.</p>
<p>Under the merger's terms, holders of General Physics stock will receive 0.60 shares of National Patent's Stock for each share of General Physics common stock.</p>
<p>The company said holders of each of National Patent and General Physics voted to approve the merger at special meetings on Jan 23.</p>
<p>National Patent provides engineering, environmental, analytical, and technical support services to nuclear and fossil power utilities, as well as the U.S. government and private businesses.</p>
</text>
